ShortTime: a Lean 4 formalization of short-time existence for higher-order parabolic equations.

This project depends on the Lean library DifferentialGeometry
(https://github.com/qinz1yang/differential-geometry, v0.1.3), Copyright 2026 The
DifferentialGeometry contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

ShortTime/Vendor/ParametricJets.lean contains verbatim copies of parts of that library
(Analysis/Spectral/Tensor/CovGrad/Parametric/{ChartRepresentation, JointSmoothness, JetBounds}.lean
and the lemmas joint_rs_add, joint_rs_sub of Parametric/JetIntegral.lean). Modifications: the
declarations were moved to the namespace ShortTime.Vendor and two unused imports were removed.
These parts remain under the Apache License 2.0.

The library itself builds on Mathlib (Apache License 2.0).
